## Sleeper car, 2:31

::bg{location="sleeper_corridor" time="night"}
::music{playback="start" mood="tense" volume="down"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: At 2:31 somebody knocks on compartment 3 as though the door owes them money.
@inspector{code="0010" mono}: I know this knock.
::use{component="lampsOut" depth="brief" where="the sleeper car" memory="The tunnel. Again." instance="use-001"}
@narrator{code="0020"}: Your casebook is on the pillow beside you, open, full of your own handwriting. The ink on the last page is still wet.
<match subject="prev.run.accused">
  <when is="solt">
    @inspector{code="0040" mono}: Last time I named the doctor and could not hold him. Not a name, then. A case.
  </when>
  <when is="lise | mirela | crane">
    @inspector{code="0050" mono}: Last time I named the wrong one, and the doctor stepped down onto the platform with his bag.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @inspector{code="0060" mono}: Last time I said nothing at all. It bought nobody anything.
  </otherwise>
</match>
@porter{code="0010" emotion="surprised"}: Inspector Wren? It's Mr. Hask in seven. He won't wake.
@inspector{code="0020"}: I know, Emil. Keep everyone in the dining car. And nobody touches the doctor's bag.
@inspector{code="0030" mono}: Ossery at six. Again. This time I name the right one.
